{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "5e50c390-03c3-8894-8bd4-85fbd818e65a",
  "created_at": "2026-02-04T11:15:57-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, City Clerk",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Isabel Furtado",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Sandra Pimentel",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-04T11:14:04-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "City Clerk's office, this is Sandra. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-04T11:14:08-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, good morning. Yes, I am looking for the library, the reading room, I want to ask about the hours. Is this the library?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-04T11:14:16-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, no, hon, this is the City Clerk at City Hall. Looks like you got us by mistake."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-04T11:14:23-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No way. Again? I think I have the wrong number from my list. I am dialing from an old list I keep in the kitchen drawer, so is probably from like ten years ago. The whole city has changed numbers and only my list stays the same."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-04T11:14:39-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That happens more than you'd think. Those old lists hang around forever. The library has its own main line, and they can tell you the hours and whether they're open today. If you look up the Newport Public Library on your phone, the number will be right at the top."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-04T11:14:56-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, yes, I can do that. I am on the cell now, I will search it. I just wanted to know if they open already, because I go after my walk."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-04T11:15:07-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, your walk. Do you get out in this cold?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-04T11:15:11-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Every morning, no matter what. I walk three miles with my neighbor, we go early, and then I am free. No way I stay inside, I get crazy."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-04T11:15:21-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good for you. Three miles, that's wonderful. Honestly I should do that. Well, once you've got the library's number they'll set you straight on the hours."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-04T11:15:30-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, I will do it right now. Sorry to bother you, I know you are busy over there."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-04T11:15:37-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No bother at all. Glad to help point you the right way. Do you need anything from the clerk's office while you're on the line?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-04T11:15:46-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, no, nothing today. Just the library. Thank you very much, Sandra."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-04T11:15:51-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome. Enjoy the rest of your day, and happy reading."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-04T11:15:55-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you, you too. Bye-bye."
    }
  ],
